<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center;">LOUISIANA'S START SAVING PROGRAM</h1>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">PAYROLL DEDUCTION AUTHORIZATION FORM</h2>

  <p>Telephone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
  <p>Internet: <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></p>
  <p>Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>

  <p><strong>INSTRUCTIONS:</strong> To initiate deposits to your account or that owned by your spouse through payroll deduction, you must complete this form. THIS FORM MUST FIRST BE APPROVED BEFORE IT WILL BE FORWARDED TO YOUR EMPLOYER. Follow these instructions to complete this form. Type or print in ink. Enter your employer's complete company name, address, telephone number and Federal Tax Identification (ID) Number. If necessary, contact your payroll department to obtain your employer's Internal Revenue Service Employer Identification Number. If you have questions, please contact the Louisiana Department of Revenue. Payroll deductions are deposited to each account. The percentages allocated to all accounts must equal 100%. Mail the completed form to the 'START Saving Program,' at the address shown above. If you need assistance in completing this form, call a Public Information and Communications Officer at the number shown above.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">NAMES OF THE ACCOUNT OWNER AND EMPLOYER</h3>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        Account Owner's (Employee's) Name (Print) <br>
        <span data-field="account_owner.full_name">{{ account_owner.full_name }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">
        Account Owner's Social Security Number <br>
        <span data-field="account_owner.ssn">{{ account_owner.ssn }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        Last <span data-field="account_owner.last_name">{{ account_owner.last_name }}</span>
      </td>
      <td>
        First <span data-field="account_owner.first_name">{{ account_owner.first_name }}</span>
      </td>
      <td>
        MI
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        Employer's Name and Mailing Address (Print) <br>
        <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">
        Address <span data-field="employer.address">{{ employer.address }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">
        City <span data-field="employer.city">{{ employer.city }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        State <span data-field="employer.state">{{ employer.state }}</span>
      </td>
      <td>
        Zip <span data-field="employer.zip">{{ employer.zip }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        Employer's Telephone <span data-field="employer.phone">{{ employer.phone }}</span>
      </td>
      <td>
        Employer's Federal Tax ID Number <span data-field="employer.tax_id">{{ employer.tax_id }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">PAYROLL DEDUCTION (Check One)</h3>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 10%;">
        <input type="checkbox" name="new_deduction">
        New Deduction
      </td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">
        <input type="checkbox" name="change_deduction">
        Change in the Present Deduction
      </td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">
        <input type="checkbox" name="terminate_deduction">
        Terminate Deduction
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Amount to deduct from salary each pay period: $ <span data-field="deduction_amount">{{ deduction_amount }}</span></p>
  <p>Pay Period or Date the payroll deduction is to begin:</p>
  <p><span data-field="start_date">{{ start_date }}</span></p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">ACCOUNT(S) IN WHICH THE PAYROLL DEDUCTION WILL BE DEPOSITED</h3>
  <p>Enter the account(s) that are to receive the deposits. If you have more than one account, you must enter the percentage of the total amount deducted from your pay that is to be credited to each account. The sum of the percentages entered must equal 100%</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%;">Beneficiary's Full Name (First, Middle, Last)</td>
        <td style="width: 25%;">Account Number(s)</td>
        <td style="width: 25%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in line_items %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].beneficiary_name">{{ item.beneficiary_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].account_number">{{ item.account_number }}</span></td>
        <td>
          <p>Percentage of Total Deduction to Each Beneficiary:</p>
          <p>{{ item.percentage }}%</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">EMPLOYEE'S (ACCOUNT OWNER'S) AUTHORIZATION</h3>
  <p>I understand that these instructions will remain in effect until changed or cancelled by me. The START Saving Program is a voluntary program, and I understand that I am not under a contractual obligation and, therefore, may cancel this authorization or change the deduction amount at any time upon notification to START Saving Program and my employer. I hereby authorize my employer to cancel any prior START Saving Program deduction forms on file. I hereby waive, on behalf of myself, my heirs, successors, agents and assigns, and any and all rights of action against the State of Louisiana, its agents, its assigns, arising out of the deduction, failure to deduct or any other handling of this request for payroll withholding.</p>

  <p>Account Owner's Signature:</p>
  <div class="signature-line" data-field="account_owner_s_signature">{{ account_owner_s_signature }}</div>
  <p>Account Owner's Spouse, if applicable:</p>
  <div class="signature-line" data-field="account_owner_s_spouse_if_applicable">{{ account_owner_s_spouse_if_applicable }}</div>

  <p>Date:</p>
  <p><span data-field="signature_date">{{ signature_date }}</span></p>

  <p>OFFICE USE ONLY:</p>
  <p>Approved date: <span data-field="approved_date">{{ approved_date }}</span></p>
  <p>Initials: <span data-field="approver_initials">{{ approver_initials }}</span></p>
  <p>Revised 08/07/2012</p>
</div>